{"version":1,"content":"<p>有媒體從產業鏈知情人士處獲悉，DeepSeek下一代大模型DeepSeek V5計劃採用華為昇騰950晶片作為核心訓練算力，項目節奏指向2027年落地。據悉，目前DeepSeek方面與華為昇騰的核心研發對接團隊常駐杭州，雙方已在V4階段完成大量底層算子適配及定製化開發，為後續模型訓練遷移和算力協同打下基礎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584854.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.258082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:08:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_hash":"953c9a60584895e42e663a4d8b1599cad8a1f7a1fe158075d8a5c1585a19e035","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}